libfabric: tell the target when a batch write cannot be posted

When the deferred post of a batch write fails, the initiator sends the target an XFER_ERROR message with the number of
writes that did complete, and the target of a notified transfer stops waiting for the rest. SGLang's KV transfers
carry no NIXL notification, so it changes nothing for them; 0005 was written on top of it upstream and does not apply
without it.

Upstream: https://github.com/ai-dynamo/nixl/pull/2107 (merged; in v1.5.0, not in the release/1.5.0 branch the PyPI
  1.5.0 wheels are built from)
Tests: none in this patch

